WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
A horned corporate presenter grins with far too much confidence.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.400
She raises a red presentation remote in front of a mandatory training screen.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.850
Rapid clicks summon a storm of presentation pages.

4
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.700
The pages gather into an enormous protective paper shield for the squad.

5
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.400
The presenter proudly explains a completely useless pie chart.

6
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.900
She waits smugly for questions. The presentation keeps going.
